      <p><seg source="#source-19686-19689">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19689-19701"><rb>何</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby>うしました。」</p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-19724-19751">と、はぎれのいゝ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19751-19766"><rb>聲</rb><rt>こゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19766-19769">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19769-19781"><rb>掛</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19781-19790">けて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19790-19814"><rb>水上</rb><rt>みなかみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19814-19826">さんが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19826-19847"><rb>格子</rb><rt>かうし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19847-19850">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19850-19862"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19862-19871">つた。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19871-19889"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19889-19895">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19895-19916"><rb>家内</rb><rt>かない</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19916-19919">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19919-19940"><rb>駈出</rb><rt>かけだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19940-19958">して、ともに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19958-19973"><rb>顏</rb><rt>かほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19973-19976">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19976-19988"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19988-19991">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19991-20003"><rb>手</rb><rt>て</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20003-20006">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20006-20021"><rb>握</rb><rt>にぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20021-20036">つた。――</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20036-20054"><rb>悉</rb><rt>くはし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20054-20057">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20057-20072"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20072-20075">は</seg><rub