ある。――</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20528-20549"><rb>途中</rb><rt>とちう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20549-20552">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20552-20564"><rb>出</rb><rt>で</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20564-20576">あつたと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20576-20588"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20588-20597">つて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20597-20630"><rb>吉井勇</rb><rt>よしゐいさむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20630-20639">さんが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20639-20663"><rb>一所</rb><rt>いつしよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20663-20666">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20666-20678"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20678-20699">えた。これは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20699-20720"><rb>四谷</rb><rt>よつや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20720-20723">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20723-20735"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20735-20738">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20738-20756"><rb>無事</rb><rt>ぶじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20756-20774">だつた。が、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20774-20789"><rb>家</rb><rt>いへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20789-20792">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20792-20807"><rb>裏</rb><rt>うら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20807-20810">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20810-20834"><rb>竹藪</rb><rt>たけやぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20834-20837">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20837-20855"><rb>蚊帳</rb><rt>かや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20855-20858">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20858-20870"><rb>釣</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20870-20876">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20876-20891"><rb>難</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><se